<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Synthetics H1 moves into red.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Synthetics H1 moves into red.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		    669 vs 836</p>
<p>    Loss before tax	 52 vs 194 profit</p>
<p>    Loss after tax	  55 vs 190 profit</p>
<p>    Dividend		 nil vs nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Pakistan Synthetics Ltd, a manufacturer of polyester staple fibre, gave no reason for the loss. It carried forward a loss of 46 million vs a profit of 190 million to the balance sheet.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
